<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices flat, ammonia up a bit on demand.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices flat, ammonia up a bit on demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) were unchanged Monday and ammonia prices were slightly higher on demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;I was pleasantly surprised to see Indiana get started so early,&quot; said one ammonia dealer.</p>
<p>Application of ammonia in Indiana, Michigan and Ohio is said to be underway, dealers said.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		175-176		  unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  187-189		  unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170-174		  unc-up 4</p>
